<label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-amber-800 mb-1">🔒 Close vs Open Game</label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-2">
<button class="rule-close-btn py-2 px-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border border-amber-500 bg-amber-500 text-white" data-closemode="true" type="button">🔒 Close Game</button>
<button class="rule-close-btn py-2 px-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700" data-closemode="false" type="button">🔓 Open Game</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 mb-4">
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkBonusOnKill" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">⚔️ Bonus Re-Roll on Kill / Capture (شکار کرنے پر دوبارہ باری — Default ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Eating/killing an opponent's bead grants an extra dice re-roll once your current dice are played (can be disabled here).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkKeepCaptureLockOnBonus" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🔒 Keep Capturing Bead Locked Across Bonus Re-Rolls in Same Bari (شکار کے بعد ری رول میں بھی گوٹی لاک رہنا — Default ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">In Close Game mode, a bead that captures an opponent remains locked on that square during all bonus re-rolls of the same Bari until your next Bari comes (changeable here).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkMandatorySpawn" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">Mandatory Hand/Yard Spawn on 6 (پہلے ہاتھ والی بیڈ نکالنا)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Must use a rolled 6 to bring a bead out from hand before moving ground beads.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkKillForHome" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">Kill Required to Enter Home + Full Loop (بغیر کِل اندر جانا منع)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Without a kill, reaching home entry forces another full 52-square outer lap.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkWipeoutResetsHomeEligibility" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">Ground Wipeout Resets Home Eligibility (میدانی صفایا پر شکار کینسل)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">If all beads on ground are killed/eaten before any bead enters Home, home eligibility is lost and clean sweep is restored until a new kill.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkTeamMode" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">2v2 Opposite-Corner Teams &amp; Safe Stacking (دو دو کی ٹیمیں)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Red+Yellow vs Green+Blue. Enemy landing on stacked teammates can only eat 1 chosen bead.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkStrictRemainder" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">Strict Near-Home Remainder Rule (بقایا نمبر کا اصول)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Cannot waste a second die near Home if no other bead can use the remainder.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkTeamAssistSix" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">Teammate Assist Requires Rolling a 1-Die Six First (ٹیم میٹ کی مدد کے لیے پہلے 6 لانا)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">After completing all your beads in 2v2, roll 1 Die for a 6 to unlock 2-Dice control of your partner's beads.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkAutoRollTurn" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🎲 Auto-Roll Dice on Turn Start (باری آنے پر خودکار ڈائس رول)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Automatically rolls the dice as soon as your turn or bonus re-roll begins (saved across reloads).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkOptionalLoopAfterKill" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🔄 Optional Outer Loop After Kill (شکار کے بعد اندر جانے یا باہر گھومنے کی مرضی)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Default OFF (must enter Home once kill is done). Enable to let players with a kill choose between entering Home or looping around the outer board again.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkWaitAllGroundAtGate" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">⏳ No-Kill Gate Wait Until All Ground Beads Gather (بغیر شکار تمام میدانی گوٹیاں جمع ہونے تک رکنا)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Default OFF (loop immediately if no kill). Enable so a player with 0 kills cannot enter Home or loop past the gate until all of their on-ground beads have reached the gate area.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkBonusOnHome" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🏠 Bonus Re-Roll on Bead Home Completion (گوٹی گھر پہنچنے پر دوبارہ باری — Default ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Grants an extra dice re-roll when any of your beads reaches the final Home triangle.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkDoubleSixBonus" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🎲 Bonus Re-Roll on 6 / Double 6 (چھکا یا ڈبل سکس پر دوبارہ باری — Default ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Grants an extra dice re-roll on 6+6 (in 2-Dice mode) or 6 (in 1-Die mode).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkSafeStopImmunity" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">★ Star Stop Safe Immunity (سٹاپ پر گوٹی محفوظ رہنا — Default ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Beads on Star/Stop squares cannot be captured. Disable if only colored starting squares should be safe.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkShowTooltips" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">💬 Show Top Tooltips &amp; Preview Hints (ٹول ٹپس دکھائیں)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Show top hint banners and floating move labels. Disable to keep the board 100% clear (saved across reloads).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkThreeConsecutiveSixes" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🚫 Three Consecutive Sixes Penalty (لگاتار 3 چھکے یا 3 ڈبل سکس باری ضائع — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">If a player rolls 6 three times in a row (in 1-Die mode) or 6+6 three times in a row (in 2-Dice mode), their entire turn is canceled and passes to the next player.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkSingleSixBonusTwoDice" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🎲 Single Six Re-Roll in 2-Dice Mode (دو دانوں میں ایک چھکے پر بھی باری — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Normally in 2-Dice Bannu Ludo you only get a bonus roll on Double Six (6+6). Enabling this grants a bonus roll even if just one of the two dice is a 6 (e.g., 6+4).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkStackRollBeforeMoving" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">📚 Store / Stack Dice on Kill &amp; Sixes Before Moving (ڈائس محفوظ کر کے اکٹھا چلنا — Default: ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">When you roll 2 dice and kill or complete on one die (e.g. rolled 5 &amp; 4 and killed on 4), you can store the remaining 5 or use it, roll your bonus dice, and use all remaining dice counts at once.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkSpawnOnOneAndSix" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">1️⃣ Spawn on 1 as well as 6 (1 یا 6 دونوں پر گوٹی کھلنا — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Allows bringing a bead out of the hand/yard on either a 1 or a 6 (popular in fast matches).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkDoubleSixSpawnsTwo" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">⚡ Double-Six Spawns Two Beads Automatically (ڈبل سکس پر دو گوٹیاں باہر آنا — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">When rolling 6+6 with 2+ beads in hand, forces bringing 2 separate beads out of hand automatically (when OFF, you may spawn 1 bead and move it by 6).</p>
</div>
</label>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded cursor-pointer" id="chkFirstBeadOnBoard" type="checkbox"/>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
<label class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 cursor-pointer" for="chkFirstBeadOnBoard">🚀 First Bead Starts Already on Board (پہلی گوٹی پہلے سے باہر ہونا — Default: OFF)</label>
<select aria-label="Starting Beads on Board" class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 rounded-lg px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-900" id="initialBeadsOnBoardSelect">
<option selected="" value="1">1 Bead Out</option>
<option value="2">2 Beads Out</option>
<option value="3">3 Beads Out</option>
<option value="4">4 Beads Out</option>
</select>
</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Every player starts the match with 1 (or set number) bead already placed on their starting square so the match begins immediately without waiting for a 6.</p>
</div>
</div>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkPairBlockadeRule" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🧱 Pair Blockade / Wall Rule (جوڑا راستہ بند کرنا — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">When 2 beads of the same player (or same team) sit on the same square, they form a "Jora" (wall). Opponent beads cannot jump over a Jora until it breaks.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkKillAllStackedEnemies" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">💥 Kill All Stacked Enemy Beads of Same Player (ایک خانے پر موجود ایک ہی کھلاڑی کی تمام گوٹیاں مارنا — Default: ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">If two or more beads of the same player (not teammates) are on the same unprotected square outside safe zones, an opponent landing on them kills both/all of that player's beads.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkTwoKillsForHome" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">⚔️⚔️ Two Kills Required for Home Entry (گھر جانے کے لیے 2 شکار لازمی — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Upgrades the blood-gate requirement from 1 kill to 2 kills before a player's home gate opens.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkOneDieWhenOneBeadLeft" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">1️⃣ Must Use 1 Die When Only 1 Bead Remains on Board (صرف آخری ایک گوٹی رہنے پر 1 ڈائس استعمال کرنا — Default: ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">As soon as a player has completed all but 1 bead (only 1 bead left anywhere on the board), they roll only 1 Die instead of 2. Even if turned OFF, reaching the Home stretch or the final point needing 1 automatically switches to 1 Die.</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkMandatoryCapture" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🎯 Mandatory Capture / Must Kill if Possible (شکار ممکن ہو تو مارنا لازمی / پھونک — Default: OFF)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">If your dice roll allows you to kill an opponent's bead, you must make the capture move (the referee highlights and forces it).</p>
</div>
</label>
<label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/90 border-2 border-amber-400 cursor-pointer whitespace-normal">
<input checked="" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-amber-600 rounded" id="chkThreeTimeoutsBotTakeover" type="checkbox"/>
<div>
<div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">🤖 3-Timeouts Auto-Bot Takeover (3 بار وقت ختم ہونے پر بوٹ کنٹرول — Default: ON)</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">If a human player lets the turn timer run out 3 turns in a row without touching the screen, the AI Bot automatically takes over their seat until they tap "Reclaim Seat".</p>
</div>
</label>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50/90 border-2 border-indigo-400 whitespace-normal md:col-span-2">
<input class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-indigo-600 rounded cursor-pointer" id="chkMultiMouseLock" type="checkbox"/>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
<label class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900 cursor-pointer" for="chkMultiMouseLock">🖱️ Multi-Mouse Per-Player Hardware Lock — 2, 3, or 4 Mice (ہر کھلاڑی کے لیے الگ ماؤس لاک — Default: OFF)</label>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-extrabold bg-white text-indigo-900 border border-indigo-300" id="multiMouseStatusPill">0 Mice Linked</span>
<button class="px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-black text-[11px] shadow-sm" id="openMultiMouseModalBtn" type="button">
                🖱️ Setup 2–4 Mice &amp; Guide
              </button>
</div>
</div>
<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1">Connect 2, 3, or 4 USB/wireless mice to your laptop using a Multi-Pointer driver (TeamPlayer4 / MouseMux on Windows, or native <code>xinput</code> on Linux). Assigns each physical mouse (via <code>event.pointerId</code>) to a specific player so each mouse can only roll and touch its own beads on its turn!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-amber-50/70 rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-amber-200 mb-4">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2.5">
<h3 class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase text-slate-800">🤖 Players, Turn Timer &amp; AI Brain Level</h3>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
<select class="bg-white border border-amber-300 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800" id="turnTimerSelect">
<option value="0">🚫 No Timer (Off)</option>
<option value="15">15s Timer</option>
<option selected="" value="30">30s Timer</option>
<option value="60">1 Minute (60s)</option>
<option value="120">2 Minutes (120s)</option>
<option value="180">3 Minutes (180s)</option>
<option value="custom">✏️ Custom...</option>
</select>
<input class="hidden w-16 bg-white border border-amber-400 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-900" id="rulesCustomTimerInput" max="3600" min="5" placeholder="Sec" type="number" value="45"/>
<select class="bg-white border border-amber-300 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-amber-900" id="aiDifficultySelect">
<option value="easy">🟢 Easy AI (Normal &amp; Forgiving)</option>
<option value="medium">🟡 Medium AI (Balanced)</option>
<option value="hard">🟠 Hard AI (Tough Tactician)</option>
<option selected="" value="hardest">🔥 Hardest AI (Utmost Expert of All Rules)</option>
</select>
<select class="bg-white border border-amber-300 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-amber-900" id="aiSpeedSelect">
<option selected="" value="default">⚡ AI Pace: Fast (Default)</option>
<option value="slow">🐢 AI Pace: Slow (Deliberate)</option>
<option value="dramatic">🎭 AI Pace: Dramatic (Suspenseful)</option>
<option value="slowest">⏳ AI Pace: Slowest (Spectator)</option>
<option value="custom">✏️ AI Pace: Custom...</option>
</select>
<input class="hidden w-16 bg-white border border-amber-400 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-900" id="rulesCustomAiSpeedInput" max="10" min="0.2" placeholder="Sec" step="0.1" type="number" value="1.5"/>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-amber-950 font-bold bg-amber-100/70 border border-amber-300/80 rounded-xl px-2.5 py-1.5 mt-2" id="rulesAiLearningBadge">
<span id="rulesAiLearningLabel">🧠 Hardest AI Adaptive Memory: Gen 1 (0 Experiences Learned • 0 Mistakes Corrected • 0 Mastered)</span>
<button class="text-[10px] underline text-amber-800 hover:text-rose-700 font-bold" id="rulesResetAiLearningBtn" type="button">Reset AI Memory</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-2">
<div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200">
<div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-700 mb-1">🔴 Red</div>
<input class="w-full bg-white border border-rose-200 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1" id="setupName0" type="text" value="You (Red)"/>
<select class="w-full bg-white border border-rose-200 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700" id="setupType0">
<option selected="" value="human">👤 Human</option>
<option value="ai">🤖 AI Bot</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200">
<div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-1">🟢 Green</div>
<input class="w-full bg-white border border-emerald-200 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1" id="setupName1" type="text" value="Sher Khan AI"/>
<select class="w-full bg-white border border-emerald-200 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700" id="setupType1">
<option value="human">👤 Human</option>
<option selected="" value="ai">🤖 AI Bot</option>
<option value="none">🚫 Empty (2P)</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">
<div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-800 mb-1">🟡 Yellow</div>
<input class="w-full bg-white border border-amber-200 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1" id="setupName2" type="text" value="Wazir Partner"/>
<select class="w-full bg-white border border-amber-200 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-700" id="setupType2">
<option value="human">👤 Human</option>
<option selected="" value="ai">🤖 AI Partner</option>
<option value="none">🚫 Empty (2P)</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200">
