          1️⃣ <b>Mandatory 6 Spawn:</b> 1 bead in hand + 1 on board (Roll 6+2)
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-xs text-slate-800 border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="blood_loop" type="button">
          2️⃣ <b>No-Kill Outer Loop:</b> At Home entry with 0 kills (Must loop board!)
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-xs text-slate-800 border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="close_game_kill" type="button">
          3️⃣ <b>Close Game Kill + Bonus Re-Roll:</b> Kill enemy on Die 1 → Capturer locks &amp; earns Kill Re-Roll!
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-xs text-slate-800 border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="team_stack_capture" type="button">
          4️⃣ <b>2v2 Team Stack Capture:</b> Enemy lands on stacked teammates (Pick 1!)
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-xs text-slate-800 border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="home_remainder" type="button">
          5️⃣ <b>Near-Home Remainder (Need 6, Roll 5+4):</b> Single vs 2 beads test
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-xs text-slate-800 border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="teammate_assist" type="button">
          6️⃣ <b>2v2 Partner Assist:</b> Red finished all beads → Roll 1-Die 6 to help Yellow!
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-xs text-slate-800 border border-amber-200 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="home_split_two_beads" type="button">
          7️⃣ <b>Near-Home Split (2 Beads):</b> 5 enters Home + 4 moves 2nd bead!
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 text-xs text-emerald-950 border border-emerald-300 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="flawless_home_entry_win" type="button">
          8️⃣ <b>Flawless Victory on Entering Home:</b> 3 beads in Home + 4th enters Home while opponents have 0 kills → Instant Win!
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 hover:bg-rose-100 text-xs text-rose-950 border border-rose-300 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="ground_wipeout_reset" type="button">
          9️⃣ <b>Ground Wipeout Resets Home Eligibility:</b> Green had 1 kill, but Red eats Green's sole ground bead before Green entered Home → Green's eligibility &amp; clean sweep immunity reset!
        </button>
<button class="scenario-load-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 text-xs text-indigo-950 border border-indigo-300 whitespace-normal" data-scenario="store_remaining_dice_bonus" type="button">
          🔟 <b>Store &amp; Stack Dice on Kill/Home:</b> Rolled 5 &amp; 4, eat Green on 4 → Store remaining 5 or move it, roll bonus dice and use all numbers together!
