<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-200 pb-2">
<h3 class="text-base font-black text-slate-900">👑 What do you want?</h3>
<button class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800" id="closeCrownCheatBtn" type="button">Ignore ✕</button>
</div>
<div class="space-y-2.5" id="crownAuthStep">
<p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Enter secret password to unlock dice control, or close to ignore:</p>
