          exampleEn: 'With 4-bead match: 3 beads are Home and Bead #4 is on outer track step 20. When ON, you roll 1 Die. When OFF, you roll 2 Dice until Bead #4 enters the Home stretch (or reaches step 5 of Home where it needs 1), then it switches to 1 Die.',
