          enDesc: 'Connect 2, 3, or 4 physical USB/Wireless mice to one laptop (using TeamPlayer4 / MouseMux on Windows, or native xinput master pointers on Linux). Each player registers their mouse hardware ID (event.pointerId) so they can only roll the dice and move their own beads during their turn.',
